The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. '''League of Legends''' was announced as part of the line-up on March 30, 2024.<ref name="EWC LOL">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ESWCgg/status/1774059629695188996|title=👑 LEAGUE OF LEGENDS ➡️ #ESPORTSWORLDCUP|date=2024-03-30|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [[esports:Esports World Cup/2024|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2024, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

