==Format==
* '''Group Stage:''' - ''July 16th & 17th''
** Two double-elimination format (GSL) groups.
*** 8 Low Seed teams (Bottom 6 [[MSI 2025]] and the 2 teams didn't actually qualified for MSI).
*** Each group has 4 teams.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top two teams}} from each group advance to the '''Playoffs'''.
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Group" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw show''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Group" style="margin-top:10px;">
* Teams are splited into 4 seed pools to ensure quality groups. The seed pools are determined based on performance at [[Mid-Season_Invitational/2025|MSI 2025]].
** 8 teams are splited into 4 pools:
*** '''Pool 1''' will consist of {{Ordinal|5|sup=yes}}-{{Ordinal|6|sup=yes}} of MSI. (''CFO'' and ''FLY'').
*** '''Pool 2''' will consist of {{Ordinal|7|sup=yes}}-{{Ordinal|8|sup=yes}} of MSI. (''G2'' and ''KOI'').
*** '''Pool 3''' will consist of {{Ordinal|9|sup=yes}}-{{Ordinal|10|sup=yes}} of MSI. (''GAM'' and ''FUR'').
*** '''Pool 4''' will consist of the 2 teams who didn't qualify for MSI. (''HLE'' and ''C9'').
* Pool 1 teams will face Pool 4 teams, while Pool 2 teams will face Pool 3 teams in the first round.
</div>

* '''Playoffs:''' - ''July 17th - 20th''
** Single-Elimination bracket.
** 8 teams, 4 High Seeds (Top 4 from [[MSI 2025]]) and 4 Qualified teams from Group Stage.
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
** All matches will be played using {{Abbr/Fearless Draft}}.
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Playoffs" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Playoffs Draw show''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Playoffs" style="margin-top:10px;">
* Top 4 teams of MSI (''GEN'', ''T1'', ''AL'', and ''BLG'') will be automatically placed in their respective places as follows:
** {{Ordinal|1|sup=yes}} and {{Ordinal|4|sup=yes}} will be in the same half of the bracket, while {{Ordinal|2|sup=yes}} and {{Ordinal|3|sup=yes}} will be in the same another half.
* Teams that pass the '''Group Stage''' are splited into 2 seed pools to ensure quality bracket. The seed pools are determined based on performance at '''Group Stage'''.
** 4 teams are splited into 2 pools:
*** '''Pool 1''' will consist of the 2 teams who pass with 2-0 record of both groups. (''G2'' and ''HLE'').
*** '''Pool 2''' will consist of the 2 teams who pass with 2-1 record of both groups. (''FLY'' and ''KOI'').
* Pool 1 teams will face {{Ordinal|3|sup=yes}} or {{Ordinal|4|sup=yes}} of MSI, while Pool 2 teams will face {{Ordinal|1|sup=yes}} or {{Ordinal|2|sup=yes}} of MSI in the first round.
</div>

* '''Patch Information'''
** All matches are played in [[Patch 25.13]]

