==Format== 
* '''Group Stage'''
** Four double-elimination format (GSL) groups.
*** Each group has 4 teams.
*** All matches ''(excl. Elim Matches)'' are {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
*** Elimination Matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top two teams}} from each group advance to the '''Playoffs'''.
* '''Playoffs'''
** Single-elimination bracket.
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
<br/>
* '''Group Stage Seeding Rules''':
** Teams are split into 4 seed pools to ensure quality groups.
*** 16 teams are split into 4 pools
**** '''Pool 1''' will consist of LCK1 (''HLE''), LCP1 (''TSW''), LEC1 (''G2''), and LPL1 (''BLG'')
**** '''Pool 2''' will consist of CN1 (''AG.AL''), KR1 (''T1''), and LCS1 (''LYON''), and Title Defender (''GEN'').
**** '''Pool 3''' will consist of APAC1 (''GAM''), CN2 (''JDG''), EU1 (''KC''), and KR2 (''DK'').
**** '''Pool 4''' will consist of CBLOL1 (''FUR''), EU2 (''MKOI''), NA1 (''SEN''), and SA1 (''MIBR.LOS'').
** Pool 1 teams will face Pool 4 teams, while Pool 2 teams will face Pool 3 teams in the first round.
** Each region can only have one team in each group.
* '''Playoffs Seeding Rules''':
** Group Winners will be drawn against Group Runners-up.
** Teams from the same group will not play each other up till the Finals.

